#: templates/summarizer/presskit.html:19
msgid "A press kit for every arXiv paper."
msgstr "Un kit presse pour chaque article arXiv."

#: templates/summarizer/presskit.html:19
msgid ""
"What is really new, a hype check (peer review, sample size, claims that go "
"beyond the results), key sentences quoted word for word, questions to ask "
"the authors, researchers who work on the same topic but did not sign the "
